  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiji Climate Action Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Activity takes a holistic programmatic approach with a combination of adaptation, mitigation, and multi-sectoral focus to increasingly move Fiji towards a climate-resilient development pathway which enables it to avert, reduce, and manage risks caused by climate vulnerability. The Activity contains long-term and strategic combination of interlinked projects aimed at achieving large scale impacts and Sotava vata na iGu ni Cokonaki (navigating resilience together).</narrative>
  </description>
